  ('17cec0fd-dbfc-514f-ab08-3bf26e29c26d', '7bba9cae-5923-56be-ba6f-5e57bac881a9', 'user', 'Good day. I would like to file a complaint. A section of drain wall along Jalan 16/6 in Seksyen 16 has collapsed, undermining the road shoulder and a boundary fence.', NULL, '2026-08-21 23:04:33+08'),
